<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 325 bln levs of T-bills next week.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 325 bln levs of T-bills next week.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer 10 issues of one-week and four-week discount T-bills with a total par of 325 billion levs and no minimum acceptable price set in advance at auctions next week, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Five issues have one-week maturity and will be offered with a maximum par of 25 billion levs each while four-week issues will have a maximum par of 40 billion levs each, the central bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Details of the issues follow.</p>
<p> ISSUE NUMBER   AUCTION DATE   ISSUE DATE   MATURITY DATE</p>
<p> BG 3029797001   April 21	 April 22     April 29</p>
<p> BG 3029897009   April 21	 April 22     May 20</p>
<p> BG 3029997007   April 22	 April 23     April 30</p>
<p> BG 3030297009   April 22	 April 23     May 21</p>
<p> BG 3030397007   April 23	 April 24     May 1</p>
<p> BG 3030497005   April 23	 April 24     May 22</p>
<p> BG 3030597002   April 24	 April 25     May 2</p>
<p> BG 3030697000   April 24	 April 25     May 23</p>
<p> BG 3030797008   April 25	 May 2	  May 9</p>
<p> BG 3030897006   April 25	 May 2	  May 30</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
